        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Minnetonka, Minnesota; Hennepin County, Minnesota; Minneapolis; Minnesota; United States\n- Companies: Cargill; United Healthcare\n- Topics: population; corporate headquarters\n\nFacts:\n- Minnetonka is a suburban city in Hennepin County, Minnesota, United States, and it is eight miles west of Minneapolis.\n- Minnetonka is home to Cargill, the largest privately owned company in the United States.\n- Minnetonka is home to United Healthcare, the largest publicly owned company in Minnesota.\n- Hennepin County is the most populous county in Minnesota and the 35th-most populous county in the United States.\n- More than one in five Minnesotans live in Hennepin County.",
